---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Atrem Project Internship Portfolio"
    description="Brutalist company profile for internship report Atrem Project."
>
    <!-- Navigation Navbar -->
    <nav class="fixed z-40 my-container navbar w-full">
        <div class="navbar-start"></div>
        <div class="border navbar-center backdrop-blur-lg rounded-3xl w-fit bg-base-100/50 border-primary/5 mx-auto">
            <div class="flex p-4 space-x-4">
                <div class="mx-8 space-x-4">
                    <a href="#company" class="nav-link">Company</a>
                    <a href="#learnings" class="nav-link">Learning</a>
                    <a href="#sideq" class="nav-link">Side Quest</a>
                    <a href="#projects" class="nav-link">Project</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="navbar-end"></div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full min-h-screen">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center text-primary leading-[100px]">
            Praktek Kerja Lapangan <br />
            <span class="text-secondary">Atrem Project</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-text">I Gede Dhiyo Lawe Wikantara</p>
        <img src="/assets/decoration/star.svg" alt="" class="absolute top-[200px] w-16 left-[200px]" />
        <img src="/assets/decoration/star.svg" alt="" class="absolute bottom-[240px] w-8 left-[400px]" />
        <img src="/assets/decoration/star.svg" alt="" class="absolute bottom-[200px] right-[440px] w-10 opacity-60" />
        <img src="/assets/decoration/star.svg" alt="" class="absolute top-[200px] right-[240px] w-12 opacity-80" />
        <img src="/assets/decoration/effect.png" alt="" class="absolute left-0 h-full" />
        <img src="/assets/decoration/effect-r.png" alt="" class="absolute right-0 h-full" />
    </header>

    <!-- Company Section -->
    <section class="pt-[200px] pb-[100px] my-container" id="company">
        <h2 class="text-center section-title">
            Tentang Agensi <br />
            <span class="text-secondary">Atrem Project</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="flex mt-16">
            <p class="flex-1 py-6 text-lg font-semibold text-center border-b-2 cursor-pointer text-text border-b-primary" id="but1">Atrem Project</p>
            <p class="flex-1 py-6 text-lg font-semibold text-center border-b-2 cursor-pointer text-text border-b-primary/30" id="but2">Sejarah Atrem Project</p>
            <p class="flex-1 py-6 text-lg font-semibold text-center border-b-2 cursor-pointer text-text border-b-primary/30" id="but3">System Internship</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-16">
            <div class="flex gap-8" id="content1">
                <img src="/assets/images/atrem.png" alt="" />
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Atrem Project</h3>
                    <p class="text-base font-medium text-text leading-[26px]"
                        >Atrem Project merupakan hasil dari inisiatif Merta Yoga, yang memulai pendirian agensi ini setelah lulus dari Sekolah Menengah Kejuruan (SMK). Agensi ini berfokus pada
                        penyediaan solusi untuk mendigitalisasi berbagai usaha. Atrem menawarkan berbagai layanan, termasuk pembuatan sistem manajemen laundry, Learning Management System (LMS),
                        jasa desain profil perusahaan, dan masih banyak lagi.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden gap-8" id="content2">
                <img src="/assets/images/history.png" alt="" class="grayscale" />
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">Sejarah Atrem Project</h3>
                    <p class="text-base font-medium text-text leading-[26px]"
                        >Semua berawal dari ketertarikan Merta Yoga pada bidang komputer, terutama setelah ia mengetahui bahwa seorang programmer dapat bekerja secara remote. Hal ini mendorongnya
                        untuk memilih SMK 1 Denpasar dengan jurusan Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak (RPL) sebagai langkah awal dalam kariernya. Setelah menyelesaikan pendidikan di SMK, Merta Yoga
                        memutuskan untuk mendirikan Atrem Project sebagai sumber penghasilan sampingan.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden gap-8" id="content3">
                <img src="/assets/images/intenr.png" alt="" class="grayscale" />
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text">System Internship</h3>
                    <p class="text-base font-medium text-text leading-[26px]"
                        >Atrem Project merekrut anggota agensi melalui sistem magang, di mana setiap angkatan disebut sebagai "batch." Saya termasuk dalam batch 6. Setiap anggota batch akan
                        diberikan tugas sesuai dengan bidang yang mereka pilih. Jika salah satu anggota batch dinilai kompeten oleh Merta Yoga, mereka akan ditawari kesempatan untuk bergabung
                        dengan Atrem Project sebagai tim yang akan menangani proyek klien.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Learnings Section -->
    <section class="my-container py-[100px]" id="learnings">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <p class="section-title max-w-[639px]">Hal - Hal Yang Di Pelajari</p>
            <p class="text-lg font-semibold leading-[27px] text-text max-w-[687px]"
                >Di Atrem Project, sistem belajarnya berbasis mentorship. Kami diberikan tugas yang harus diselesaikan secara mandiri, dan jika mengalami kesulitan, kami dapat mendiskusikannya.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-4 mt-16">
            <div class="space-y-8 border-r skill-card border-r-primary/20">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 text-3xl solar-ux mx-auto"></div>
                <div class="text-xl font-bold text-center">UX Research</div>
                <p class="text-[18px] font-medium text-center">Selama di sini, saya diperkenalkan dengan UX Research, yang merupakan tahap pertama dalam pembuatan aplikasi atau website.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-8 border-r skill-card border-r-primary/20">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 text-3xl solar-research mx-auto"></div>
                <div class="text-xl font-bold text-center">UX Testing</div>
                <p class="text-[18px] font-medium text-center">Di sini, saya diajarkan cara melakukan UX testing yang benar, mulai dari mencari responden hingga cara menanggapi mereka. </p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-8 border-r skill-card border-r-primary/20">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 text-3xl solar-prototype mx-auto"></div>
                <div class="text-xl font-bold text-center">UI Prototyping</div>
                <p class="text-[18px] font-medium text-center">
                    Di sini, saya mengeksplorasi UI Prototyping, di mana saya membuat animasi dan user flow di Figma untuk meningkatkan kualitas tahap UX Testing.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-8 border-r skill-card group">
                <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 65" fill="white" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="fill-primary group-hover:fill-white mx-auto">
                    <path
                        d="M32 13.46C23.5378 13.46 18.2489 17.6911 16.1333 26.1533C19.3067 21.9222 23.0089 20.3355 27.24 21.3933C29.6533 21.996 31.3787 23.748 33.288 25.6866C36.4027 28.8466 40 32.5 47.8667 32.5C56.3289 32.5 61.6178 28.2688 63.7333 19.8066C60.56 24.0377 56.8578 25.6244 52.6267 24.5666C50.2107 23.964 48.488 22.212 46.5733 20.2733C43.4667 17.1133 39.8667 13.46 32 13.46ZM16.1333 32.5C7.67111 32.5 2.38222 36.7311 0.266663 45.1933C3.44 40.9622 7.14222 39.3755 11.3733 40.4333C13.7867 41.036 15.512 42.788 17.424 44.7266C20.5333 47.8866 24.1333 51.54 32 51.54C40.4622 51.54 45.7511 47.3089 47.8667 38.8466C44.6933 43.0777 40.9911 44.6644 36.76 43.6066C34.344 43.004 32.6213 41.252 30.7067 39.3133C27.6 36.1533 24 32.5 16.1333 32.5Z"
                    />
                </svg>
                <div class="text-xl font-bold text-center">Tailwind</div>
                <p class="text-[18px] font-medium text-center">Tailwind adalah framework CSS yang terkenal. Di sini, saya dibina dan diajarkan cara menggunakan Tailwind dengan benar dan efektif.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Side Quest Section -->
    <section class="my-container py-[100px]" id="sideq">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2">
            <div class="pr-32 space-y-6">
                <p class="section-title">Side Quest</p>
                <p class="text-lg font-medium text-text"> Di Atrem Project terdapat Side Quest, dimana Side Quest ini berfungsi sebagai tumpukan asset untuk Atrem Project </p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-transparent border-b rounded-none collapse border-b-black/50">
                    <input type="radio" class="peer" name="my-accordion-1" checked />
                    <div class="collapse-title peer-checked:text-white text-primary peer-checked:bg-primary">Mini Blog Atrem Tech Zone</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content bg-base-100 peer-checked:bg-primary peer-checked:text-white">
                        Saya mendapatkan Side Quest untuk membuat blog untuk menjadi referensi konten Atrem Tech Zone yang merupakan akun informatif dari Atrem Project
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-transparent border-b rounded-none collapse border-b-black/50">
                    <input type="radio" class="peer" name="my-accordion-1" />
                    <div class="collapse-title peer-checked:text-white text-primary peer-checked:bg-primary">Target Promosi Jasa</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content bg-base-100 peer-checked:bg-primary peer-checked:text-white">
                        Kami mendapatkan Side Quest mencari website atau instagram dari berbagai bidang usaha yang akan digunakan sebagai target promosi jasa Atrem Project
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-transparent border-b rounded-none collapse border-b-black/50">
                    <input type="radio" class="peer" name="my-accordion-1" />
                    <div class="collapse-title peer-checked:text-white text-primary peer-checked:bg-primary">Referensi UI Company Profile</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content bg-base-100 peer-checked:bg-primary peer-checked:text-white">
                        Saya mendapatkan Side Quest untuk mencari 300+ referensi UI yang digunakan sebagai referensi dari pembuatan portofolio Atrem Project
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-transparent border-b rounded-none collapse border-b-black/50">
                    <input type="radio" class="peer" name="my-accordion-1" />
                    <div class="collapse-title peer-checked:text-white text-primary peer-checked:bg-primary">Referensi Sistem</div>
                    <div class="collapse-content bg-base-100 peer-checked:bg-primary peer-checked:text-white">
                        Saya Mendapatkan Side Quest untuk mengumpulkan referensi sistem yang digunakan untuk mengupgrade sistem - sistem yang akan di buat atau sudah di buat
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Projects Section -->
    <section class="py-[100px] my-container" id="projects">
        <p class="text-center section-title">
            Project Yang Saya <br />
            Kerjakan
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-16">
            <a href="/proto/" class="block p-6 duration-300 text-text hover:text-white hover:bg-primary hover:scale-105 group active:scale-95 border border-primary/10">
                <img src="/assets/images/proto-thumb.png" alt="" />
                <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                    <p class="text-2xl font-bold">16 UI Prototyping Project</p>
                    <div class="flex space-x-2">
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">UX Testing</div>
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">UI Prototyping</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="/28ui/" class="block p-6 duration-300 text-text hover:text-white hover:bg-primary hover:scale-105 group active:scale-95 border border-primary/10">
                <img src="/assets/images/ui-thumb.png" alt="" />
                <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                    <p class="text-2xl font-bold">28 UI Design Project</p>
                    <div class="flex space-x-2">
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">UX Research</div>
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">UX Testing</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="/mira/" class="block p-6 duration-300 text-text hover:text-white hover:bg-primary hover:scale-105 group active:scale-95 border border-primary/10">
                <img src="/assets/images/mira-thumb.png" alt="" />
                <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                    <p class="text-2xl font-bold">Mira Course</p>
                    <div class="flex space-x-2">
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">UX Research</div>
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">UX Testing</div>
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">UI Prototyping</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="/package/" class="block p-6 duration-300 text-text hover:text-white hover:bg-primary hover:scale-105 group active:scale-95 border border-primary/10">
                <img src="/assets/images/package-thumn.png" alt="" />
                <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                    <p class="text-2xl font-bold">Package Monitoring Frontend Slicing</p>
                    <div class="flex space-x-2">
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">Tailwind</div>
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">Basic JS</div>
                        <div class="duration-200 my-badge group-hover:bg-white group-hover:text-text">Daisy UI</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer Scene (original, untouched) -->
    <section class="footer-scene" aria-label="Footer crowd">
        <canvas
            id="crowd-canvas"
            data-peeps-canvas
            data-peeps-src="/assets/images/open-peeps-sheet.avif"
            aria-hidden="true"
        ></canvas>
        <noscript>
            <img class="footer-peeps-fallback" src="/assets/images/open-peeps-sheet.avif" alt="" />
        </noscript>

        <footer id="contact" class="layout-footer" aria-label="Footer" data-reveal>
            <p>designed & coded by Dhio for Atrem Project |&nbsp;</p>
            <a href="/#projects">works</a>
        </footer>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
    const button1 = document.getElementById("but1");
    const button2 = document.getElementById("but2");
    const button3 = document.getElementById("but3");
    const content1 = document.getElementById("content1");
    const content2 = document.getElementById("content2");
    const content3 = document.getElementById("content3");

    function tabs(button, secbutton, thirdbutton, content) {
        button1?.classList.remove("border-b-primary");
        button2?.classList.remove("border-b-primary");
        button3?.classList.remove("border-b-primary");
        
        button1?.classList.add("border-b-primary/30");
        button2?.classList.add("border-b-primary/30");
        button3?.classList.add("border-b-primary/30");

        content1?.classList.add("hidden");
        content2?.classList.add("hidden");
        content3?.classList.add("hidden");

        button?.classList.add("border-b-primary");
        button?.classList.remove("border-b-primary/30");
        
        content?.classList.add("flex");
        content?.classList.remove("hidden");
    }

    button1?.addEventListener("click", () => tabs(button1, button2, button3, content1));
    button2?.addEventListener("click", () => tabs(button2, button1, button3, content2));
    button3?.addEventListener("click", () => tabs(button3, button1, button2, content3));
</script>
